              This  option signs queries using TSIG with the given authentica‐
              tion key.  kkeeyynnaammee is the name of the key,  and  sseeccrreett  is  the
              base64-encoded  shared secret. hhmmaacc is the name of the key algo‐
              rithm;  valid  choices  are  hhmmaacc--mmdd55,  hhmmaacc--sshhaa11,  hhmmaacc--sshhaa222244,
              hhmmaacc--sshhaa225566,  hhmmaacc--sshhaa338844, or hhmmaacc--sshhaa551122. If hhmmaacc is not speci‐
